---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: Pi Durable 1.3.0 admission, tool effects, and recovery
  accDescr: A host submits a request with a stable requestId. Admission, tool intent, tool results, and the final answer are committed before publication. Model requests and external tool effects run outside storage transactions. After reopening, the harness resumes task checkpoints; interrupted safe tools may replay and external effects therefore require idempotency.

  Host["Host<br/>root.submit(input, context)<br/>Stable input.requestId"]:::csPrimary
  Admission["Atomic storage admission<br/>User entry + durable task"]:::csAccent
  Generation["pi.generation<br/>Model request outside transaction"]:::csPrimary
  Intent["Commit assistant + tool intent<br/>pi.tool task"]:::csAccent
  Effect["Tool execute()<br/>Outside storage transaction<br/>External effects need idempotency"]:::csMuted
  Result["Commit tool result"]:::csAccent
  Answer["Commit final answer<br/>Settle submission"]:::csAccent
  Done["submission.wait(context)<br/>status: #quot;done#quot;"]:::csPrimary
  Restart["Process restart<br/>Harness.open(...); harness.resume()"]:::csMuted
  Checkpoint["Persisted task checkpoint<br/>Resume its phase"]:::csAccent

  Host --> Admission --> Generation
  Generation -->|final response| Answer --> Done
  Generation -->|tool calls| Intent --> Effect --> Result
  Result -->|next turn| Generation
  Restart --> Checkpoint
  Checkpoint -.->|generation phase| Generation
  Checkpoint -.->|tool phase: safe replay only| Effect
  Checkpoint -.->|unsafe tool: interrupted result| Result
  classDef csPrimary fill:#9e1b32,stroke:none,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:0px;
  classDef csAccent fill:#000000,stroke:none,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:0px;
  classDef csMuted fill:#828282,stroke:none,color:#000000,stroke-width:0px;
